    {
      "bbox": [
        237,
        1600,
        1897,
        1776
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, salvage is all items that are obsolete or unserviceable beyond repair, as well as items that are no longer required for the operation of an agency, i.e., desks, chairs, carpets, lamps, repair equipment, machinery, etc.; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2582,
          "min": -1.3183
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.056
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8561,
        "area_px": 287094,
        "density": 0.02982,
        "chars": 232,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 27.1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        237,
        1814,
        1818,
        1906
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, it is necessary and desirable to take full advantage of every revenue-producing source; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2474,
          "min": -1.3957
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.0023,
          "min": -0.0339
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3347,
        "area_px": 143499,
        "density": 0.02332,
        "chars": 100,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 29.88
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        237,
        1944,
        1849,
        2077
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, each agency must evolve a realistic program for discarding all items that can no longer be utilized, in order to take full advantage of their salvageable value; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2235,
          "min": -1.2477
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 35,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0016
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6020,
        "area_px": 210916,
        "density": 0.02854,
        "chars": 173,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 28.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        237,
        2115,
        1897,
        2253
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, many of these items may ostensibly appear to be of no value, but will bring revenue into the City Treasury at a salvage sale; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1611,
          "min": -1.1531
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0037
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6349,
        "area_px": 227080,
        "density": 0.02796,
        "chars": 138,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        237,
        2286,
        1770,
        2380
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the value of salvageable items generally decreases the longer they remain in an agency;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2074,
          "min": -1.4545
